   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-05-07",
   "text": "Disclosure of Tax Havens and Offshoring Act \n This bill requires certain issuers of securities to annually disclose information related to the tax jurisdiction, income, and assets of their constituent entities on a country-by-country basis."
